--- String Length & Indexing ---
len: 6
char[0]: S
char[5]: M
char[10] == nil: true
char[-1]: nil
--- Contains Builtin ---
contains Sage: true
contains VM: true
contains xyz: false
contains empty: true
--- StartsWith & EndsWith ---
startswith Sage: true
startswith VM: false
endswith VM: true
endswith Sage: false
--- Replace Builtin ---
replace a with o: bonono
replace na with XX: baXXXX
replace empty: banana
--- Strip, Upper, Lower ---
strip: 'hello WORLD'
upper:   HELLO WORLD
lower:   hello world
--- Substring Slicing ---
slice 0..4: Sage
slice 2..6: geVM